```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller
    participant Contract as DoubleFinancingPreventer
    participant FileStore as assetFiles mapping

    Caller->>Contract: verifyFile(assetId, providedHash)
    Contract->>Contract: require(bytes(assetFiles[assetId].fileHash).length > 0)

    alt Hash matches
        Contract-->>Caller: true (PASS - file integrity confirmed)
    else Hash does not match
        Contract-->>Caller: false (FAIL - file may be tampered)
    end

    Note over Caller,Contract: Anyone can verify by:<br/>1. Downloading the file from fileURI<br/>2. Computing SHA-256 locally<br/>3. Calling verifyFile to compare
```